title: Penelope_LoadPhase
---
<<declare $dialoguePhase_Penelope= "">>
<<setPhase Penelope>>
<<if $dialoguePhase_Penelope == "begin">>
<<jump Penelope_Begin01>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase_Penelope == "comeback">>
<<jump Penelope_Comeback01>>
<<else>>
Penelope: You didn't make this dialogue yet!
<<endif>>
===
title: Penelope_Begin01
---
<<camMove Penelope_CamRig "npc">>
Penelope: Wow you actually found me!
Penelope: I'd say that deserves a Maxwell.
<<collectMaxwell GameController>>
<<camMove Penelope_CamRig "pc">>
You: Wow, thanks!
<<camMove Penelope_CamRig "return">>
<<getPhase Penelope "comeback">>
===
title: Penelope_Comeback01
---
<<camMove Penelope_CamRig "npc">>
Penelope: I've given you all I can! Beat it!
<<camMove Penelope_CamRig "return">>
===